# A schematic Mastering Mixology lab for replays. Not the real map: just the things the Pilot points
# at, laid out on one open floor near where the Mastering Mixology plugin by hex-agon places them.
#
# Facts:
#  - names are RuneLite's (net.runelite.api.gameval): the levers MM_LAB_SWITCH_MOX, _AGA and _LYE;
#    the mixing vessel MM_LAB_VESSEL; the stations MM_LAB_MACHINE_AGITATOR, _RETORT and _ALEMBIC;
#    the conveyor belt MM_LAB_CONVEYOR; the hopper MM_LAB_HOPPER; the refiner MM_LAB_MILL; the
#    four digweed patches MM_HERB_1 to _4
#  - OSRS wiki, Mastering Mixology: the hopper is "next to the levers", the vessel "behind them",
#    the conveyor belt "to the north", the refiner "next to the bank chest in the south-east",
#    digweed grows "in one of the corners of the room"
#
#   y 9331  herbNW            conveyor            herbNE
#   y 9329                    agitator
#   y 9326                    vessel   (player 9327)
#   y 9325  alembic                         retort
#   y 9324              lye aga mox
#   y 9322  herbSW            hopper              herbSE
#   y 9320                                  refiner
#   y 9318                                  bank
#        x 1389                                    1399

scene 1340 9270

object MM_LAB_SWITCH_LYE 1393 9324 as lyeLever
object MM_LAB_SWITCH_AGA 1394 9324 as agaLever
object MM_LAB_SWITCH_MOX 1395 9324 as moxLever
object MM_LAB_VESSEL 1394 9326 as vessel
object MM_LAB_MACHINE_ALEMBIC 1391 9325 as alembic
object MM_LAB_MACHINE_AGITATOR 1393 9329 as agitator
object MM_LAB_MACHINE_RETORT 1397 9325 as retort
object MM_LAB_CONVEYOR 1394 9331 as conveyor
object MM_LAB_HOPPER 1394 9322 as hopper
object MM_LAB_MILL 1398 9320 as refiner
name 90000 "Bank chest"                  # a stand-in chest: the Pilot finds banks by name
object 90000 1398 9318 as bank
object MM_HERB_1 1399 9331 as herbNE
object MM_HERB_2 1399 9322 as herbSE
object MM_HERB_3 1389 9322 as herbSW
object MM_HERB_4 1389 9331 as herbNW
